   1002  f187
   1003  f187							; --- Call bank1 for 13+2 HUD rendering via fold-pad at $FC68 ---
   1004  f187							; The fold-pad at $FC68 has identical bytes in bank0 and bank1:
   1005  f187							;   $FC68: lda #1 / sta $1FF7 / jmp $F540
   1006  f187							; After sta $1FF7, CPU reads next instruction from bank1 at $FC6D.
   1007  f187							; Bank1's $FC6D has the same jmp $F540 → seamless bank switch.
   1008  f187		       4c 68 fc 	      jmp	$FC68	; jump to fold-pad (switches to bank1, runs MenuMain)
   1009  f18a							; Bank1's MenuMain returns to bank0 via: lda #0 / sta $1FF6 / jmp Overscan
   1010  f18a
