   1990  f5f3							; $F82C pin gap (upstream of the $F8DD sprite pin, so the pre-pad END is
   1991  f5f3							; unaffected and the 15 B the folded chain frees stays free). Every non-raft arm
   1992  f5f3							; tail-jumps, exactly like the old inline chain, so the stack depth is unchanged.
