   2270  f746							; CallPad_RaftBody — bank1 RaftBody entry. Pinned at $F8C0 with a
   2271  f746							; BYTE-IDENTICAL twin in bank1 (bank1.asm, same address): the `sta $1FF7`
   2272  f746							; switches banks, so the `jmp` opcode AND its operand are fetched from bank1,
   2273  f746							; not from here. That is the same FoldIndirect discipline every other tramp
   2274  f746							; uses — the twin cannot be skipped or shortened.
   2275  f746							; Guard: verify_build.check_raft_tramp (identity + operand == bank1 RaftBody).
   2276  f746		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	$F8C0 - *, 0
