   3807  ff60							; --- travel: +/-4 px toward the facing (PlayerDir live), capped at the
   3808  ff60							; old S3 sweep extent (SweepOff max 16: right tip <= RoomX+20, left
   3809  ff60							; floor max(RoomX-20,0)) — past the cap restarts at the eye, the
   3810  ff60							; triangle-loop feel of the sweep (user: beam "moved way beyond the
   3811  ff60							; limit"). RectCount = free scratch (LWC re-owns it for its row walk).
   3812  ff60				   .LAdvStep
   3813  ff60		       a4 82		      ldy	PlayerDir
   3814  ff62		       a5 83		      lda	LaserX
   3815  ff64		       18		      clc
   3816  ff65		       79 de ff 	      adc	StepDelta,y	; dir 0 = +4, dir 1 = -4 (table after eye)
   3817  ff68				   .LAdvS
